* Physical AI - Experiment 13 architecture C: passive input dividers plus unity buffers
* resistor-divider voltage domains; no per-weight CCCS gain
* Frozen Experiment 9 network A. Weights were not edited.
* Behavioral circuit analysis. Not transistor-level or PCB power.
* divider Ra=999000 Rb=1000 beta=0.001 Ileak=0 rail=15 linear=False
* shape: 2 -> 4 -> 1

Vin1 in1 0 DC 0
Rdiv1a in1 tap1 999000
Rdiv1b tap1 0 1000
Ediv1 inf1 0 tap1 0 1
Vin2 in2 0 DC 0
Rdiv2a in2 tap2 999000
Rdiv2b tap2 0 1000
Ediv2 inf2 0 tap2 0 1
Vref vref 0 DC 1
Rdivrefa vref tapref 999000
Rdivrefb tapref 0 1000
Edivref vreff 0 tapref 0 1

* h1 input 1 w=+0.683760795348816 w+  bank=n alpha=1 R=48749.9920441162 G_phys=2.05128238604645e-05 G_eff=2.05128238604645e-05
Rh1p1n1 in1 h1p 48749.9920441162
