Rh1bnf1 vreff h1n 1253.18954325804
Vh1p h1p 0 DC 0
Vh1n h1n 0 DC 0
Fh1p 0 h1d Vh1p 1
Fh1n h1d 0 Vh1n 1
Vh1d h1d 0 DC 0
Hh1 h1lin 0 Vh1d 33333.3333333333
* direct bounded ReLU: y=max(0, min(15, v(h1lin))) no high-gain op-amp loop
Bh1relu h1y 0 V = max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))
Eh1 h1buf 0 h1y 0 1

